#         653, A141 comment: This compilation upgrades Asplund et al. (2009) with the advances in photospheric modeling and atomic data
#         in the last decade. Notably, it preserves a low O abundance but increases Ne/O to 0.24, in line with Young 2018 and Landi &
#         Testa 2017 determinations in the solar atmosphere.', sha256: 665f6a911c66d71ffd9def879c9b12836f25986bb4f01a8f054e58af31661a86}
